   m_sSRZReadText "Artifact formation. Artifacts form inside the fields themselves, one or two per field, and they are invisible to the eye. Only a detector shows them, and better detectors pick up the rarer formations. If a field is stripped it stays empty for about an hour and then forms again. Every artifact changes the carrier in some way. Most of them also take something back. Read the scanner before you trust one."
